  The caption and reel_script say Stalin's objection was to the police search, but the article only says he condemned the search; the draft's caption says he claimed the raid was to divert attention from drug smuggling - this matches the article. However, the caption states the case is 'பின்னணியில்' (background), which is acceptable. The main issue: the reel_script says 'வழக்கு பதிவாகியுள்ளது' and the article says a case was registered - fine. One genuine problem: the reel_script states 'அரசியல் காரணங்களுக்காக' attributed to Stalin as an accusation of political motives, which matches the article's 'பொய் வழக்குகள்' - no issue there.
  The reel_script is missing the article's key claim that Stalin accused the TVK government of law-and-order failure and that the raids target DMK ex-ministers whenever TVK faces criticism, and it omits the article's statement that Chief Minister Vijay was criticized - an important point of the article is missing from the reel_script's account of Stalin's statements.
  The caption's Madurai police search English footer is fine, but the caption's '📰 முழு விவரம்' section states 'பெரிய போதைப்பொருள் கடத்தல்களில் இருந்து கவனத்தைத் திசை திருப்பவே' which mirrors the article, so no issue there.
